### 获取最近24小时的测量数据
GET http://localhost:3000/api/measurements?hours=24&limit=100

### 获取特定规格的测量数据
GET http://localhost:3000/api/measurements?specId=dn20xen23&hours=24

### 获取单条测量数据
GET http://localhost:3000/api/measurements/1

### 获取合规性统计
GET http://localhost:3000/api/measurements/stats/compliance?startTime=2023-05-01T00:00:00Z&endTime=2023-05-31T23:59:59Z

### 获取按规格分组的统计
GET http://localhost:3000/api/measurements/stats/specs?startTime=2023-05-01T00:00:00Z&endTime=2023-05-31T23:59:59Z

### 获取趋势数据 (小时)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/measurements/stats/trend?startTime=2023-05-01T00:00:00Z&endTime=2023-05-07T23:59:59Z&interval=hour

### 获取趋势数据 (天)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/measurements/stats/trend?startTime=2023-05-01T00:00:00Z&endTime=2023-05-31T23:59:59Z&interval=day

### 清理过期数据 (保留90天)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/measurements/maintenance/cleanup?days=90

### 优化数据库
POST http://localhost:3000/api/measurements/maintenance/optimize 